Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 19:13:41 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?=EC=A0=95=EB=B9=84=20=EC=9D=B4=EB=A0=A5=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EC=82=AD=EC=A0=9C=20=EA=B8=88=EC=A7=80?=
